<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 22.31 pct, 3-mo 22.11 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 22.31 pct, 3-mo 22.11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) fell in both the one- and three-month maturities, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 22.31, down from 22.45 percent, and the three-month rate at 22.11 percent, down from 22.15 percent, the NBH said on its BUBOR Reuters page.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
